<title>HONG KONG: Shell Elec seen in share placement - sources.</title>
<headline>Shell Elec seen in share placement - sources.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Electric Manufacturing (Holdings) Co Ltd is seen placing 50 million existing shares at HK$5.50 per share to third party investors before the company issued the same amount of new shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>No other details on the placing and on the use of proceeds are available, sources said.</p>
<p>Shell Electric officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Shares of the electrical appliances manufacturer ended unchanged at HK$6.05 each on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
